# Godot 4+ specific ignores
.godot/
.wrangler/
/android/
/build/
.DS_Store
.superpowers/
.worktrees/
node_modules/
*.import

# Local secrets (Cloudflare API tokens, etc.) — never commit these
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# 玩家角色 v6 过渡产物：新图落地后模型要重做，不入库
# 最终角色 GLB 是交付物，入库；中间的 Tripo 重建产物不入库
assets/generated_models/
assets/source_art/player_characters/bases_tinted/
docs/assets/player-characters/recolor-qa/*.png
!docs/assets/player-characters/recolor-qa/_all10.png

# 派生基体：由 derive_base_girth.py 从现有基体几何派生，可随时重跑
assets/characters/derived/

# Tripo 重建产物：可由 tripo_multiview.py 重跑，task_id 记录在 tripo-tasks.jsonl
